 ran (priors.txt, written 02:36:01 UTC; first WebSearch about 02:36:03 UTC). All search rows of this batch were logged after the fact, in one pass.', 0, 'Follow-up: expect the Ieder(in) reply to endorse or criticise the revised ramp requirements.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:42', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (151, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'SE', 'SV', NULL, 'code', NULL, 'Boverket BBR rampens lutning högst 1:12 tillgänglighet ramp avsnitt 3:14 föreskrifter', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 9, 9, 0, 'none', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:05', 'Surfaced Boverket BBR comparison PDFs, municipal guidelines and BFS 2011:5 ALM 2 hosted by Varbergs kommun. Tool summary: ''public places ramp 1:20 between >=2 m landings''. A prior that Sweden states one ~1:12 figure is partly wrong: two settings, two figures (below).', 0, 'Boverket BBR (BFS 2011:6 as amended) 3:14 ramp gradient limit near 1:12 with a 1:20 recommendation; expect a Boverket PDF; Sweden had 1 prior search, 0 admitted.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:05', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
