s on that exec (a follow-up prior composed at logging time, after the first retrieval).', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:42', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (184, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'KR', 'EN', NULL, 'code', NULL, 'Enforcement Rule of the Act on Guarantee of Promotion of Convenience of Persons with Disabilities, Senior Citizens, and Pregnant Women', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 10, 10, 0, 'none', NULL, NULL, 1, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'LOGGED AFTER THE FACT (backfill=1). It returned ten KLRI results, among them the Korean-language Enforcement DECREE page (elaw.klri.re.kr/kor_service/lawView.do?hseq=69834), a KLRI e-book (hseq=64668) and English Acts. These were not screened when the search ran, and the KR conclusion on the earlier KLRI exec (''translation not found'') was reached without them. They were screened in the repair phase: the DECREE (시행령) is not the Enforcement RULE (시행규칙) that carries Annex 1; the official Annex 1 of the Rule was then found by the domain-limited Korean search logged next, and retrieved.', 0, 'BACKFILLED (R8): this query was run at about 02:40 UTC on 2026-10-01, with allowed_domains elaw.klri.re.kr, law.go.kr and moleg.go.kr, and was NOT logged at the time; the adversarial pass (finding F3) caught the omission. No prior was recorded before it ran; the expectation then in mind was that KLRI''s index would list the Enforcement Rule or an English translation of its Annex 1.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (185, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'KR', 'KO', NULL, 'code', NULL, '장애인·노인·임산부 등의 편의증진 보장에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별표 1 편의시설의 구조·재질 등에 관한 세부기준', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 10, 10, 0, 'none', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'Surfaced law.go.kr/LSW/flDownload.do?flSeq=162983711 -- Annex 1 of the Enforcement RULE under the stamp <개정 2023. 12. 11.> -- plus the Decree''s Annex 1 (flSeq=127034675, <개정 2022. 4. 27.>, a different instrument), easylaw pages and moleg pre-announcements. The earlier unrestricted Korean queries had returned only a legal wiki and installer-marketplace pages: the failure was the unrestricted index, not the absence of an official host. Direct retrieval follows.', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: a domain-limited Korean query (law.go.kr, moleg, easylaw, koreanlii, KLRI) would surface the official Annex 1 download that the unrestricted searches did not.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (186, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'KR', 'KO', NULL, 'code', NULL, 'https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/flDownload.do?flSeq=162983711', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'saturated', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'RETRIEVED, 200, 489 kB, 22 pp. PDF (author metadata ''법제처 국가법령정보센터'', created 2026-03-31). Annex 1 of 시행규칙 <개정 2023. 12. 11.>. Item 12 나목: (1) 경사로 기울기 12분의 1 이하 (''하여야 한다''); (2) relaxable to 8분의 1 only if all of: existing facility, height <= 1 m with 1/12 structurally difficult, continuous assistance service. 비고 (p. 22): items phrased ''…할 수 있다'' are 권장사항. Reads identically to the NEPLA mirror (REF-01019). Admitted T6 COMPLETE-STATUTORY VERIFIED as REF-01031; the mirror''s rows are re-rooted to it. The law.go.kr PAGE URL still resets the connection (curl exit 35); the flDownload endpoint does not.', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: the official download serves Annex 1 as a PDF, in which item 12 reads as the mirror did.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (187, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'NL', 'NL', 1, 'co1', NULL, 'Ieder(in) over ons netwerk mensen met een beperking of chronische ziekte organisaties bestuur ervaringsdeskundigen statuten', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 10, 10, 0, 'none', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'Surfaced iederin.nl/over-iederin, /onze-leden, annual reports and position papers. Tool summary (NOT bytes): more than 200 member organisations, ''Nothing about us without us'', a board of six named people. NOT USED as evidence. Direct fetches of /over-iederin/ and /onze-leden/ returned HTTP 202 with a 180-byte bot-challenge stub (meta refresh to /.well-known/sgcaptcha/): artefacts a836bdbc7ef3655e.html and f09f27d41341ea64.html, which are RETRIEVAL FAILURES, NOT ABSENCE. Consequence: Ieder(in)''s Co-1 warrant is unevidenced in the bytes, and REF-01022 was re-filed as T3 grey.', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: Ieder(in)''s own pages would state who governs the network (whether disabled people control it), which D-0178 needs for a Co-1 warrant.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (188, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'PT', 'PT', NULL, 'code', NULL, 'Decreto-Lei 163/2006 regime da acessibilidade versão consolidada alterado Decreto-Lei 136/2014 Decreto-Lei 125/2017 anexo normas técnicas rampas', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 10, 10, 0, 'none', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'Surfaced files.dre.pt/1s/2006/08/15200/56705689.pdf (the DR original, 1.ª série N.º 152, 8 Aug 2006), the diariodarepublica.pt consolidated pages (JavaScript shells) and the PGDL consolidation. Tool summary said the decree was amended by DL 136/2014 and DL 125/2017; PGDL''s own page lists FOUR amendments (136/2014, 125/2017, 95/2019, 10/2024). Direct retrievals follow.', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: a domain-limited search (pgdlisboa, dre.pt, diariodarepublica.pt, inr.pt) would surface the Diário da República original and a consolidated text with its amendment list.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (189, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'PT', 'PT', NULL, 'code', NULL, 'https://files.dre.pt/1s/2006/08/15200/56705689.pdf', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'saturated', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'RETRIEVED, 200, 555 kB, 20 pp. (DR pp. 5670-5689; the decree begins on p. 5670 under ''MINISTÉRIO DO TRABALHO E DA SOLIDARIEDADE SOCIAL''). Anexo 2.5.1-2.5.2 on DR p. 5678 (PDF p. 9) read identically to the transcription: 6% (rise <=0.6 m, projection <=10 m) or 8% (rise <=0.4 m, projection <=5 m), interpolation permitted; existing buildings 10% / 12% concessions. Admitted T6 COMPLETE-STATUTORY VERIFIED as REF-01032; the transcription''s rows are re-rooted to it.', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: the DR original carries Anexo 2.5 with the same rise-and-run table as the Ordem dos Arquitectos transcription.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (190, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'PT', 'PT', NULL, 'code', NULL, 'https://pgdlisboa.pt/leis/lei_mostra_articulado.php?artigo_id=3110A0002&nid=3110&tabela=leis&ficha=1', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 'partial', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'RETRIEVED, 200, 70 kB HTML (plus the artigo_id=3110A0027 and 3110A0028 nodes, 64 kB each, which loaded the same decree front page, not the Anexo). Lists FIVE versions: 163/2006, 136/2014 (9 Sept), 125/2017 (4 Oct), 95/2019 (18 July), 10/2024 (8 Jan). The Anexo node did not load, so WHETHER ANY AMENDMENT ALTERED ANEXO 2.5 REMAINS UNVERIFIED. Not admitted (an index page).', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: the PGDL consolidation lists the decree''s amendments and, per article, which text each changed.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
INSERT INTO "search_executions" ("exec_id", "slug", "jurisdiction", "language", "target_tier", "target_evidence_type", "target_scope", "query_text", "terms_used", "engine", "depth_method", "mining_direction", "results_found", "results_screened", "results_admitted", "saturation_signal", "admitted_ref_ids", "deferred_reason", "backfill", "created_by_session", "created_at", "findings_note", "harm_finding", "prior_expectation", "origin", "mined_ref_id", "origin_pass_id", "updated_at", "updated_by_session") VALUES (191, 'accessible-circulation-geometry', 'NL', 'NL', 1, 'co1', NULL, 'https://iederin.nl/over-iederin/', NULL, 'web', 'scoping', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'none', NULL, NULL, 0, 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23', '2026-10-01 03:41', 'RETRIEVAL FAILURE, NOT ABSENCE: https://iederin.nl/over-iederin/ and https://iederin.nl/onze-leden/ each answered HTTP 202 with a 180-byte HTML stub that refreshes to /.well-known/sgcaptcha/ (bot challenge); artefacts a836bdbc7ef3655e.html and f09f27d41341ea64.html persisted in the manifest as failed retrievals. Ieder(in)''s governance therefore remains unevidenced in the bytes.', 0, 'No pre-registered prior: this row records a repair-phase action taken in response to an adversarial-pass finding, and the expectation stated is the one formed from that finding, after the pass had read the record. Expectation: the page states who governs the network.', 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-01 03:41', 'session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23');
